{"title":"Career Roadmap: Feed Nutritionist","role":"Feed Nutritionist","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Dairy / Animal Husbandry / Poultry Science · Target Career: Feed Nutritionist","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Dairy / Animal Husbandry / Poultry Science"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Feed Nutritionist designs feed for dairy cattle, poultry or fish - balancing nutrients and cost - and helps farmers feed animals for health and productivity."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Feed Nutritionist does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulate least-cost feed rations"},{"text":"Test raw materials and feeds"},{"text":"Advise farmers and sales teams"},{"text":"Track animal performance on the feed"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Feed manufacturing companies"},{"text":"Dairy cooperatives and integrators"},{"text":"Premix and additive companies"},{"text":"Research institutes"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Nutrition Executive"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Feed Nutritionist"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Senior Nutritionist"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Nutrition"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Technical Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Animal science and biochemistry"},{"text":"Visit a feed mill"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text